  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "APARTMENT 10 -“The Circle” 90 KITCHENER ROAD MILFORD \r\n\r\nPositioned on the 11th floor of the tightly held Circle Apartments in Milford, this is an exceptionally rare opportunity to secure an entire floor in one of the North Shore's most iconic apartment buildings. \r\n\r\nSet on well over an acre (5,228sqm) of beautifully landscaped grounds and just a short, level walk from Milford Village, Milford Beach, and everyday amenities, this remarkable residence offers an enviable lifestyle with breathtaking panoramic views. Constructed from solid concrete and well ahead of its time, The Circle remains one of Milford's most sought-after apartment buildings. Comprising just 12 full-floor residences, each apartment occupies an entire level, providing exceptional privacy, generous proportions and direct lift access to the front door. \r\n\r\nSpanning approximately 170sqm , the subject apartment enjoys spectacular 360- degree views encompassing the Hauraki Gulf, Rangitoto Island, Lake Pupuke, Auckland’s CBD, and the Waitakere Ranges. Every room has been positioned to maximise these ever-changing vistas, creating a space that feels both expansive and connected to its extraordinary surroundings. The designer kitchen, renovated approximately three years ago, features quality appliances, elegant white cabinetry and generous workspace, flowing effortlessly into the expansive open-plan living and dining area where extensive glazing frames the magnificent outlook. \r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises three generous double bedrooms, each enjoying outstanding natural light and uninterrupted views. The master suite is particularly impressive, offering a walk-in wardrobe, beautifully appointed ensuite and wonderful afternoon sun. Practicality has also been well considered, with double garaging, a large separate storage room and excellent visitor parking. Residents enjoy access to a swimming pool, vegetable gardens (by approval) and secure gated access directly to the shores of Lake Pupuke, adding further appeal to an already exceptional lifestyle. \r\n\r\nWhole-floor apartments of this calibre are incredibly tightly held and rarely become available. Combining substantial proportions, solid construction, spectacular views and one of Milford's most desirable locations, this is a genuine opportunity to secure one of the North Shore's finest apartment residences.\r\n\r\nIF YOU CAN'T REACH ANDREW DORREEN, PLEASE CONTACT HIS SALES ASSOCIATE ANNA JONES ON 021 489 171",
